In a game of solitaire, a player can perform various moves to progress the game. Given the current state of the game, what would be the resulting game state after performing a specific move? The move can involve dealing from the stock, restoring the stock, moving cards from the waste to the tableau, moving piles within the tableau, or moving cards to the foundations.

