Given the following input:

{'reindeer_descriptions': ['Reindeer1 can fly 50 km/s for 24 seconds, but then must rest for 21 seconds.', 'Reindeer2 can fly 32 km/s for 10 seconds, but then must rest for 20 seconds.', 'Reindeer3 can fly 24 km/s for 14 seconds, but then must rest for 13 seconds.'], 'given_time': 2819}

