In a Minesweeper game, a grid of hidden cells contains a certain number of bombs. Players can reveal cells to uncover whether they contain bombs or not. Given the dimensions of the grid and the number of bombs, what will be the state of the game after revealing a specific cell? The possible states are "winning" (all non-bomb cells are revealed), "losing" (a bomb cell is revealed), or "unfinished" (the game is still ongoing).

