    Perform a specified operation on a binary search tree constructed from a list of keys.

    :param keys: List[float or int] - A list of keys to insert into the binary search tree.
    :param operation: str - The operation to perform on the tree. Can be "depth", "has_key", or "remove".
    :return: int or bool or None - The result of the operation.
