Given the following input:

{'fen_string': 'WWK WBQ WWK  \\ WBN  WWP  \\ WBR     \\    WBRWWR \\  WWQ WBP WBP\\WWR      \\WBN WWB WWB  \\  WBK WWK  \\W'}

