Given a rectangular board filled with 'X's and 'O's, where 'X' represents a captured area and 'O' represents a free area, determine the final state of the board after applying the following rule: Any 'O' that is not on the border and is not connected to an 'O' on the border will be captured and turned into 'X'. What will be the final configuration of the board?

