In a game of Omaha poker, two players are dealt four cards each, and five community cards are placed on the board. Each player must use exactly two of their own cards and three of the community cards to form the best possible five-card hand. Given the cards in hand 1, hand 2, and the board, who will win the hand? What are the strengths of both hands?

