Given a set of coordinates along an axis, how can we determine the optimal positions for ticks on the axis and the maximum number of characters required to display these ticks? The problem requires us to consider whether the ticks should be automatically generated or placed on every coordinate, and to ensure that the number of ticks meets a specified minimum requirement.

