Given a Binary Search Tree (BST) with a specified root value and a maximum node constraint, what is the status of the BST (whether it is full based on the constraint) after inserting a list of values into it? Additionally, what is the sorted order of the values in the BST after the insertion?

The input and output requirements are as follows:

