In a game of Connect Four, players take turns dropping their pieces into a grid. The first player to get four of their pieces in a row (horizontally, vertically, or diagonally) wins the game. Given the dimensions of the board and a sequence of moves, determine if any player has won the game after the given moves. What is the result of the game after the specified moves?

The input and output requirements are as follows:

Input:
